  "contentHtml": "<p>수업시간에 항상 X형태, 빨강과 파랑, 염색체 4개만 그렸거든요.</p><p>학생들이 이해를 잘 하고 있는지 궁금했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>원격수업기간이라, 집에서 염색체 6개를 표현해보도록 과제를 내주었습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>사진1)&#160; DNA복제 전 염색체수 6</p><p>사진2) DNA복제 후</p><p>사진3) 체세포분열 후 딸세포2개</p><p>&#160;</p><p>재료들이 참 재미나고 참신하더라구요</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85621abb376c93a2869fb2737bd2593144185e77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85621abb376c93a2869fb2737bd2593144185e77\" data-origin-width=\"2896\" data-origin-height=\"2896\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cbfcd52b7ae0759ee2bdc32f62dab255a10173b0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cbfcd52b7ae0759ee2bdc32f62dab255a10173b0\" data-origin-width=\"2896\" data-origin-height=\"2896\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/873e296d5b7eb551fd050fdb52c53cfedf0924b5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/873e296d5b7eb551fd050fdb52c53cfedf0924b5\" data-origin-width=\"2896\" data-origin-height=\"2896\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
